 "notes": [
  "Posted 13 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (8)': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Endor: Bunker, Endor (the three the Objective deploys), Operational As Planned (starting interrupt, 'lost'), and Moff Jerjerrod, Death Star II and Desperate Counter (taken into hand by Operational As Planned); these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Endor', 'Endor Landing Platform (Docking Bay)', 'Endor Bunker', 'Kashyk' and 'Sullest' dested the Dark pages Endor (Dark), Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark), Endor: Bunker (Dark), Kashyyyk (Dark) and Sullust (Dark); 'Death Star II' dested Death Star II (Dark).",
  "Posted 'Lt. Hebsley' dested Lieutenant Hebsly (the strategy pairs him with Scythe 3); 'Admiral Piet' Admiral Piett; 'Chimera' Chimaera.",
  "Posted 'Something Special Planned...\tOE/ There is no Try' on one line is two Effects: Something Special Planned For Them and There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement; the Effects section is headed 10 and counts 10 with both.",
  "Posted 'Darth Mauls Light Saber' dested Maul's Lightsaber (the Tatooine weapon; Darth Maul With Lightsaber is a later character); 'Mara Jade' dested Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand.",
  "Posted 'Darth Vader w/ Lightsaber' dested Darth Vader With Lightsaber (Death Star II); 'We are in Attack Position Now' We're In Attack Position Now.",
